lumn":36,"offset":2100},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.saas.product-vs-service"}}],"anchors":{"tentang-topik-ini":{"type":"header","text":"Tentang Topik Ini","value":"tentang-topik-ini","line":14,"column":0,"depth":2},"entry-point--mulai-dari-sini":{"type":"header","text":"Entry Point — Mulai dari Sini","value":"entry-point--mulai-dari-sini","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"klaster-gagasan":{"type":"header","text":"Klaster Gagasan","value":"klaster-gagasan","line":26,"column":0,"depth":2},"definisi-saas-dan-multi-tenancy":{"type":"header","text":"Definisi SaaS dan Multi-Tenancy","value":"definisi-saas-dan-multi-tenancy","line":28,"column":0,"depth":3},"variasi-dan-discipline":{"type":"header","text":"Variasi dan Discipline","value":"variasi-dan-discipline","line":36,"column":0,"depth":3},"terminologi-dan-mindset":{"type":"header","text":"Terminologi dan Mindset","value":"terminologi-dan-mindset","line":45,"column":0,"depth":3},"catatan-kaitan":{"type":"header","text":"Catatan Kaitan","value":"catatan-kaitan","line":55,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"6ie1ckeu7jfftzq54vt9e44","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"moc-multi-tenant-saas-architecture\">MOC: Multi-Tenant SaaS Architecture<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#moc-multi-tenant-saas-architecture\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"tentang-topik-ini\">Tentang Topik Ini<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tentang-topik-ini\"></a></h2>\n<p>Topik ini berfokus pada bagaimana multi-tenant SaaS seharusnya dilihat sebagai service model operasional terpadu, bukan hanya sekadar shared infrastructure. MOC ini mengumpulkan gagasan dari Tod Golding dan catatan Chapter 1 yang menyorot same-version discipline, boundary tenant, dan perbedaan antara SaaS, MSP, dan installed software.</p>\n<h2 id=\"entry-point--mulai-dari-sini\">Entry Point — Mulai dari Sini<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#entry-point--mulai-dari-sini\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.building-multi-tenant-saas-architectures\">Building Multi-Tenant SaaS Architectures</a> — ringkasan buku dan navigasi utama</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.building-multi-tenant-saas-architectures.chapter-1\">Chapter 1 — The SaaS Mindset</a> — ringkasan Chapter 1</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.building-multi-tenant-saas-architectures.chapter-1.close-reading\">Chapter 1 Close Reading — The SaaS Mindset</a> — close reading paragraf-per-paragraf</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"klaster-gagasan\">Klaster Gagasan<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#klaster-gagasan\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"definisi-saas-dan-multi-tenancy\">Definisi SaaS dan Multi-Tenancy<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#definisi-saas-dan-multi-tenancy\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124500\">SaaS sebagai unified operational service model, bukan label infrastruktur</a> — SaaS sebagai unified operational service model, bukan label infrastruktur</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124502\">SaaS adalah business and delivery model</a> — SaaS adalah business and delivery model</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124509\">Multi-tenancy SaaS = unified tenant experience</a> — Multi-tenancy SaaS = unified tenant experience</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124508\">Classic multi-tenancy terlalu sempit</a> — Classic multi-tenancy terlalu sempit</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124514\">SaaS berbeda dengan MSP</a> — SaaS berbeda dengan MSP</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"variasi-dan-discipline\">Variasi dan Discipline<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#variasi-dan-discipline\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124503\">Installed software pain adalah customer variation</a> — Installed software pain adalah customer variation</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124504\">Pain terbesar model lama adalah hilangnya agility</a> — Pain terbesar model lama adalah hilangnya agility</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124505\">Unified model adalah jawaban terhadap fragmentasi</a> — Unified model adalah jawaban terhadap fragmentasi</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124506\">Same-version sebagai litmus test SaaS</a> — Same-version sebagai litmus test SaaS</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124511\">Dedicated infra belum tentu anti-SaaS</a> — Dedicated infra belum tentu anti-SaaS</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124510\">Shared and dedicated resources bisa berdampingan dalam SaaS</a> — Shared and dedicated resources bisa berdampingan dalam SaaS</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"terminologi-dan-mindset\">Terminologi dan Mindset<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#terminologi-dan-mindset\"></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124501\">SaaS bukan technology-first mindset</a> — SaaS bukan technology-first mindset</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124515\">SaaS adalah service, bukan product saja</a> — SaaS adalah service, bukan product saja</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124512\">Hindari istilah single-tenant dalam konteks SaaS</a> — Hindari istilah single-tenant dalam konteks SaaS</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124513\">Boundary SaaS ditentukan oleh apa tenant lihat</a> — Boundary SaaS ditentukan oleh apa tenant lihat</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260511124507\">Cross-cutting capabilities adalah fondasi SaaS</a> — Cross-cutting capabilities adalah fondasi SaaS</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"catatan-kaitan\">Catatan Kaitan<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#catatan-kaitan\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.saas.product-vs-service\">Product vs Service dalam SaaS</a> — contoh publik perbandingan product vs service</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #f8481c;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.structure-note\">structure-note</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #edc8ff;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.moc\">moc</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">saas (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enableUserTags":true,"enableHashTags":true,"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","enableAutoFoldFrontmatter":false,"enableEditorDecorations":true,"maxPreviewsCached":10,"maxNoteLength":204800,"seeds":{"dendron.templates":{}},"enableFullHierarchyNoteTitle":false},"preview":{"enableFMT